<noscript><style>form.antibot > * { display: none !important; } form.antibot noscript { display: block !important; }</style>
</noscript><meta name="description" content="USDA has estimated annual production costs and returns and published accounts for major field crop and livestock enterprises since 1975. Cost and return estimates are reported for the United States and major production regions for corn, soybeans, wheat, cotton, grain sorghum, rice, peanuts, oats, barley, milk, hogs, and cow-calf. These cost and return accounts are &quot;historical&quot; accounts based on the actual costs incurred by producers." />
