					    <div id="block-uswds-ers-content" class="block block-system block-system-main-block">
  
    
      <article data-history-node-id="3782">

  
    

  
  <div>
    
	<div class="usa-prose">
		<p>Cost and return estimates are reported for the United States and major production regions for corn, soybeans, wheat, cotton, grain sorghum, rice, peanuts, oats, barley, milk, hogs, and cow-calf. The series of commodity cost and return estimates for the <strong>U.S. and regions</strong> is divided into<strong>&nbsp;Recent</strong> and&nbsp;<strong>Historical</strong> estimates. Recent estimates date back to the most recent major revision in accounting methods, account format, and regional definitions for each commodity. Historical estimates date back to when the series began. <strong>Cost-of-Production Forecasts</strong>&nbsp;are also available for major U.S. field crops.&nbsp;<a href="/data-products/commodity-costs-and-returns/organic-costs-and-returns" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="451c1277-34ac-46f8-aeda-b030279e2fd4" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-udi="umb://document/00910351d742415ab254114ea945dbb9" title="Organic Costs and Returns" class="usa-link">Organic Costs and Returns</a> for corn, milk, wheat, and soybeans are also available.</p>
<p>Also, see the ERS <a href="/data-products/milk-cost-of-production-estimates" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="0d9c123f-7a44-48f5-b64b-4f5142ddf291" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-id="15539" data-udi="umb://document/cbae559a4b4e406e8aa0161a093c3b99" title="Milk Cost of Production Estimates" class="usa-link">Milk Cost of Production Estimates data product</a>.</p>
	</div>

  </div>

</article>

  </div>


